## 定義

「共和與恐怖」是[政治革命]研究中的子概念? They call it grandchild classification. It examines relation between republican political order and organized revolutionary terror. It doesn't mean every republic is terror nor all terror republican. It is analytical pairing to study when emergency governance transforms into institutional violence while invoking public sovereignty.

First occurrence plain-language:
- 「共和」在此指... public power not hereditary monarchy, constituted through law/elections/representation.
- 「恐怖」在此指... state/revolutionary organization uses detention, executions, confiscation, purges under emergency, based on political suspicion, to defend/reshape revolution.
Need first occurrence terms plain-language one sentence.

Then [法國大革命] paradigmatic: [舊制度] fiscal crisis/privilege, [巴士底] 1789, constitutional monarchy, republic 1792, Louis XVI execution Jan 1793, levée, Committee, Terror 1793-94, Robespierre fall July 1794, [拿破崙] 1799, restoration? This category captures interplay.

